From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:27:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] presentation: collapse complete browsing headers and reveal
 navigation immediately

Use one surface color, transparent system areas and a shared header height including categories and filters. Observe reverse drag before the top bar consumes it. Shared chrome implementation and regressions match Mihon 0048; Anikku uses a 120ms bottom reveal and preserves cast controls.
